        {
            "id": 12725,
            "question_id": 23823,
            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "uk",
            "hint": "Лексична основа: work — працювати. У прямому запитанні допоміжне дієслово передує підмету; питальна частина стоїть перед ним. Часовий зв’язок з минулою подією має зберегтися.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:57.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:57.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 12726,
            "question_id": 23823,
            "provider": "compose_prompt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Use the past perfect continuous for the earlier process. Start with the question phrase or auxiliary; keep other circumstances after the verb group. Ask whether your listener spent time working before dinner began.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:57.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:57.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 12727,
            "question_id": 23823,
            "provider": "chatgpt",
            "locale": "en",
            "hint": "Lexical verb: work. In a direct question the auxiliary precedes the subject, with the question phrase first. Preserve the relation to the later past event.",
            "created_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:57.000000Z",
            "updated_at": "2026-10-04T22:49:57.000000Z"
        },
        {
            "id": 12728,
